#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the IBM Cloud Resource Controller REST API to get, list, update, and create IBM Quantum Compute Service instances."
msgstr "Gamitin ang IBM Cloud Resource Controller REST API para kumuha, maglista, mag-update, at lumikha ng mga instance ng IBM Quantum Compute Service."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use IBM Cloud Resource Controller API for instance management"
msgstr "Gamitin ang IBM Cloud Resource Controller API para sa pamamahala ng instance"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "{/* cspell:ignore ResourceController  */}\n"
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore Abluemix, apikey */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore ResourceController  */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use IBM Cloud Resource Controller API for instance management {#use-ibm-cloud-resource-controller-api-for-instance-management}"
msgstr "Gamitin ang IBM Cloud Resource Controller API para sa pamamahala ng instance {#use-ibm-cloud-resource-controller-api-for-instance-management}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use the IBM Cloud&reg; Resource Controller REST API to programmatically get, create, and update [instances](/guides/instances). \n"
msgstr "Maaari mong gamitin ang IBM Cloud&reg; Resource Controller REST API para programmatically na kumuha, lumikha, at mag-update ng mga [instance](/guides/instances). \n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "All Resource Controller endpoints require that you authenticate by passing a header called `Authorization` with the bearer token. Refer to the [REST API setup guide](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api).\n"
msgstr "Lahat ng endpoint ng Resource Controller ay nangangailangan na mag-authenticate ka sa pamamagitan ng pagpasa ng header na tinatawag na `Authorization` na may bearer token. Sumangguni sa [REST API setup guide](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get an instance {#get-an-instance}"
msgstr "Kumuha ng instance {#get-an-instance}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the [`GET /v2/resource_instances/{crn}`](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#get-resource-instance) endpoint to get information about a particular instance. The [CRN](/guides/instances) must be URL-encoded in the path.\n"
msgstr "Gamitin ang [`GET /v2/resource_instances/{crn}`](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#get-resource-instance) endpoint para makakuha ng impormasyon tungkol sa isang partikular na instance. Ang [CRN](/guides/instances) ay dapat na URL-encoded sa path.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In addition to the standard Resource Controller fields, the response includes quantum-specific fields in both `parameters` and `extensions`. `extensions` stores the instance's normalized metadata, whereas `parameters` only stores the most recent request to modify the instance. Therefore, you should read from `extensions` rather than `parameters`.\n"
msgstr "Bukod sa mga standard na field ng Resource Controller, kasama sa response ang mga field na tukoy sa quantum sa parehong `parameters` at `extensions`. Iniimbak ng `extensions` ang normalized na metadata ng instance, samantalang ang `parameters` ay nag-iimbak lamang ng pinakahuling request na mag-modify sa instance. Kaya, dapat kang magbasa mula sa `extensions` sa halip na `parameters`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `extensions` object includes these fields:\n"
msgstr "Kasama sa object na `extensions` ang mga field na ito:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`instance_limit_seconds` — Integer, or `null`. The usage time limit for the instance. See [Set instance allocation limits](/guides/allocation-limits).\n"
msgstr "`instance_limit_seconds` — Integer, o `null`. Ang limitasyon ng oras ng paggamit para sa instance. Tingnan ang [Set instance allocation limits](/guides/allocation-limits).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage_allocation_seconds` — Integer, or `null`. The time allocated to this instance, used by the [fair-share scheduler](/guides/fair-share-scheduler) to determine queue priority. See [Set instance allocation limits](/guides/allocation-limits).\n"
msgstr "`usage_allocation_seconds` — Integer, o `null`. Ang oras na inilaan para sa instance na ito, ginagamit ng [fair-share scheduler](/guides/fair-share-scheduler) para matukoy ang priyoridad sa pila. Tingnan ang [Set instance allocation limits](/guides/allocation-limits).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`backends` — Array of strings. The allowlist of backend names available to this instance. `[\"ANY\"]` means all backends on the plan are available (the default). `[]` means no backends are available.\n"
msgstr "`backends` — Array ng mga string. Ang allowlist ng mga pangalan ng backend na available sa instance na ito. Ibig sabihin ng `[\"ANY\"]` na lahat ng backend sa plano ay available (ang default). Ibig sabihin ng `[]` na walang available na backend.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"The backends field may be outdated\">\n"
"  The `backends` field in the `extensions` object may be outdated. This can happen when IBM Quantum Support changes your account in a way that impacts instances. For example, when a backend is removed from an account, it will update the `backends` for the instance, but that change is currently not yet reflected in the Resource Controller API.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Maaaring luma na ang field na backends\">\n"
"  Ang field na `backends` sa object na `extensions` ay maaaring luma na. Maaari itong mangyari kapag binago ng IBM Quantum Support ang iyong account sa paraang nakakaapekto sa mga instance. Halimbawa, kapag inalis ang isang backend mula sa isang account, iu-update nito ang `backends` para sa instance, ngunit ang pagbabagong iyon ay hindi pa naipapakita sa Resource Controller API sa kasalukuyan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Instead, the current workaround is to use the [IBM Quantum Compute Service REST API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest) with the [`GET /v1/backends`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest/tags/backends#tags__backends__operations__list_backends) endpoint. (Make sure that you set the `Service-CRN` header to your instance's CRN.)\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"  Sa halip, ang kasalukuyang workaround ay gamitin ang [IBM Quantum Compute Service REST API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest) kasama ang [`GET /v1/backends`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest/tags/backends#tags__backends__operations__list_backends) endpoint. (Siguraduhing itakda mo ang header na `Service-CRN` sa CRN ng iyong instance.)\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"curl\" label=\"cURL\">\n"
"    The CRN must be URL-encoded in the path. Replace each `:` with `%3A` and each `/` with `%2F`. For example, `crn:v1:bluemix:...` becomes `crn%3Av1%3Abluemix%3A...`.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"curl\" label=\"cURL\">\n"
"    Ang CRN ay dapat na URL-encoded sa path. Palitan ang bawat `:` ng `%3A` at ang bawat `/` ng `%2F`. Halimbawa, ang `crn:v1:bluemix:...` ay nagiging `crn%3Av1%3Abluemix%3A...`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    curl \\\n"
"      --request GET \\\n"
"      --url 'https://resource-controller.cloud.ibm.com/v2/resource_instances/<YOUR_INSTANCE_CRN_URL_ENCODED>' \\\n"
"      --header 'Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_BEARER_TOKEN>'\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  <TabItem value=\"python\" label=\"Python\">\n"
msgstr "  <TabItem value=\"python\" label=\"Python\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    import urllib.parse\n"
"    import requests\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    crn = \"<YOUR_INSTANCE_CRN>\"\n"
"    # We use urllib.parse.quote to URL-encode the CRN.\n"
"    url = (\n"
"        \"https://resource-controller.cloud.ibm.com/v2/resource_instances/\"\n"
"        + urllib.parse.quote(crn, safe=\"\")\n"
"    )\n"
msgstr ""
"    crn = \"<YOUR_INSTANCE_CRN>\"\n"
"    # We use urllib.parse.quote to URL-encode the CRN.\n"
"    url = (\n"
"        \"https://resource-controller.cloud.ibm.com/v2/resource_instances/\"\n"
"        + urllib.parse.quote(crn, safe=\"\")\n"
"    )\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    resp = requests.get(\n"
"        url,\n"
"        headers={\"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\"},\n"
"        timeout=30,\n"
"    )\n"
"    resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"    print(resp.json())\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"    resp = requests.get(\n"
"        url,\n"
"        headers={\"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\"},\n"
"        timeout=30,\n"
"    )\n"
"    resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"    print(resp.json())\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get a list of all instances {#get-a-list-of-all-instances}"
msgstr "Kumuha ng listahan ng lahat ng instance {#get-a-list-of-all-instances}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the [`GET /v2/resource_instances`](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#list-resource-instances) endpoint to get a list of all your instances. Set the `resource_id` query parameter to `b6049020-80f4-11eb-a0f7-e35ec9b4054f` to filter to IBM Quantum&reg; instances.\n"
msgstr "Gamitin ang [`GET /v2/resource_instances`](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#list-resource-instances) endpoint para makakuha ng listahan ng lahat ng iyong instance. Itakda ang query parameter na `resource_id` sa `b6049020-80f4-11eb-a0f7-e35ec9b4054f` para mag-filter sa mga instance ng IBM Quantum&reg;.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If your account has multiple plans and you want to filter by plan, set the `resource_plan_id` query parameter to one of the following values:\n"
msgstr "Kung ang iyong account ay may maraming plano at gusto mong mag-filter ayon sa plano, itakda ang query parameter na `resource_plan_id` sa isa sa mga sumusunod na halaga:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Plan | `resource_plan_id` |\n"
"|------|---------------------|\n"
"| Premium | `7f666d17-7893-47d8-bf9d-2b2389fc4dfc` |\n"
"| Flex | `53bde9d3-cdbb-46f5-a98f-60ebcadf7260` |\n"
"| Pay-As-You-Go | `5304b575-3cff-4455-90dc-ae4367762093` |\n"
"| Open | `850b21a7-71de-4e53-9441-1abdd202f35d` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Plano | `resource_plan_id` |\n"
"|------|---------------------|\n"
"| Premium | `7f666d17-7893-47d8-bf9d-2b2389fc4dfc` |\n"
"| Flex | `53bde9d3-cdbb-46f5-a98f-60ebcadf7260` |\n"
"| Pay-As-You-Go | `5304b575-3cff-4455-90dc-ae4367762093` |\n"
"| Open | `850b21a7-71de-4e53-9441-1abdd202f35d` |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each result includes the same `extensions` field as described in [Get an instance](#get-an-instance).\n"
msgstr "Kasama sa bawat resulta ang parehong field na `extensions` na inilarawan sa [Get an instance](#get-an-instance).\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"curl\" label=\"cURL\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"curl\" label=\"cURL\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    curl \\\n"
"      --request GET \\\n"
"      --url 'https://resource-controller.cloud.ibm.com/v2/resource_instances?resource_id=b6049020-80f4-11eb-a0f7-e35ec9b4054f' \\\n"
"      --header 'Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_BEARER_TOKEN>'\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
