#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Update an instance {#update-an-instance}"
msgstr "I-update ang isang instance {#update-an-instance}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the [`PATCH /v2/resource_instances/{crn}`](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#update-resource-instance) endpoint to update the limit, allocation, and permitted backends for an instance. The [CRN](/guides/instances) must be URL-encoded in the path.\n"
msgstr "Gamitin ang [`PATCH /v2/resource_instances/{crn}`](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#update-resource-instance) endpoint para i-update ang limit, allocation, at pinapayagang mga backend para sa isang instance. Ang [CRN](/guides/instances) ay dapat na URL-encoded sa path.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pass a `parameters` JSON object in the request body with the fields you want to change, along with the header `\"Content-Type: application/json\"`. Omitted fields are left unchanged.\n"
msgstr "Magpasa ng `parameters` JSON object sa request body kasama ang mga field na gusto mong baguhin, kasama ang header na `\"Content-Type: application/json\"`. Ang mga field na hindi isinama ay mananatiling hindi nagbabago.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage_allocation_seconds` — Integer, or `null`. The time allocated to this instance, used by the [fair-share scheduler](/guides/fair-share-scheduler) to determine queue priority. See [Set instance allocation limits](/guides/allocation-limits). Not applicable to Pay-As-You-Go instances.\n"
msgstr "`usage_allocation_seconds` — Integer, o `null`. Ang oras na inilaan para sa instance na ito, ginagamit ng [fair-share scheduler](/guides/fair-share-scheduler) para matukoy ang priyoridad sa pila. Tingnan ang [Set instance allocation limits](/guides/allocation-limits). Hindi applicable sa mga Pay-As-You-Go instance.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`backends` — Array of strings. The allowlist of backend names available to this instance. `[\"ANY\"]` means all backends on the plan are available. `[]` means no backends are available.\n"
msgstr "`backends` — Array ng mga string. Ang allowlist ng mga pangalan ng backend na available sa instance na ito. Ibig sabihin ng `[\"ANY\"]` na lahat ng backend sa plano ay available. Ibig sabihin ng `[]` na walang available na backend.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Always include a unique timestamp\">\n"
"  The API silently ignores the request if `parameters` is identical to the previous request. In the `parameters` object, always include a `timestamp` field set to the current time so each request is treated as unique.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Palaging isama ang isang natatanging timestamp\">\n"
"  Tahimik na binabalewala ng API ang request kung ang `parameters` ay kapareho ng nakaraang request. Sa object na `parameters`, palaging isama ang field na `timestamp` na itinakda sa kasalukuyang oras para ituring na natatangi ang bawat request.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The endpoint's response is similar to [getting an instance](#get-an-instance), including how it handles the `extensions` object.\n"
msgstr "Ang response ng endpoint ay katulad ng [pagkuha ng isang instance](#get-an-instance), kasama ang paraan ng paghawak nito sa object na `extensions`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    curl \\\n"
"    --request PATCH \\\n"
"    --url 'https://resource-controller.cloud.ibm.com/v2/resource_instances/<YOUR_INSTANCE_CRN_URL_ENCODED>' \\\n"
"    --header 'Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_BEARER_TOKEN>' \\\n"
"    --header 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n"
"    --data \"{\n"
"        \\\"parameters\\\": {\n"
"            \\\"timestamp\\\": \\\"$(date -u +\"%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ\")\\\",\n"
"            \\\"usage_allocation_seconds\\\": 220\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\"\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    import urllib.parse\n"
"    import datetime\n"
"    import requests\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    timestamp = datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).strftime(\"%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ\")\n"
"    body = {\n"
"        \"parameters\": {\n"
"            \"timestamp\": timestamp,\n"
"            \"usage_allocation_seconds\": 220,\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"
msgstr ""
"    timestamp = datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).strftime(\"%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ\")\n"
"    body = {\n"
"        \"parameters\": {\n"
"            \"timestamp\": timestamp,\n"
"            \"usage_allocation_seconds\": 220,\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    resp = requests.patch(\n"
"        url,\n"
"        headers={\n"
"            \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\",\n"
"            \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n"
"        },\n"
"        json=body,\n"
"        timeout=30,\n"
"    )\n"
"    resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"    print(resp.json())\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"    resp = requests.patch(\n"
"        url,\n"
"        headers={\n"
"            \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\",\n"
"            \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n"
"        },\n"
"        json=body,\n"
"        timeout=30,\n"
"    )\n"
"    resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"    print(resp.json())\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a new instance {#create-a-new-instance}"
msgstr "Lumikha ng bagong instance {#create-a-new-instance}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the [`POST /v2/resource_instances`](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#create-resource-instance) endpoint to create (provision) a new instance. Pass a JSON body with the header `\"Content-Type: application/json\"`.\n"
msgstr "Gamitin ang [`POST /v2/resource_instances`](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#create-resource-instance) endpoint para lumikha (mag-provision) ng bagong instance. Magpasa ng JSON body kasama ang header na `\"Content-Type: application/json\"`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Required fields:\n"
msgstr "Mga kinakailangang field:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`name` — A human-readable name for the instance.\n"
msgstr "`name` — Isang pangalan para sa instance na madaling basahin ng tao.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`target` — The region, such as `us-east` or `eu-de`.\n"
msgstr "`target` — Ang region, tulad ng `us-east` o `eu-de`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`resource_plan_id` — The plan for this instance. See the [plan ID table](#get-a-list-of-all-instances).\n"
msgstr "`resource_plan_id` — Ang plano para sa instance na ito. Tingnan ang [talahanayan ng plan ID](#get-a-list-of-all-instances).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`resource_group` — The [resource group](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-rgs) to use.\n"
msgstr "`resource_group` — Ang [resource group](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-rgs) na gagamitin.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also include a `parameters` object to set quantum-specific values:\n"
msgstr "Maaari ka ring magsama ng `parameters` object para itakda ang mga halagang tukoy sa quantum:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    curl \\\n"
"      --request POST \\\n"
"      --url 'https://resource-controller.cloud.ibm.com/v2/resource_instances' \\\n"
"      --header 'Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_BEARER_TOKEN>' \\\n"
"      --header 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n"
"      --data '{\n"
"          \"name\": \"my-new-instance\",\n"
"          \"target\": \"us-east\",\n"
"          \"resource_plan_id\": \"7f666d17-7893-47d8-bf9d-2b2389fc4dfc\",\n"
"          \"resource_group\": \"<YOUR_RESOURCE_GROUP_ID>\",\n"
"          \"parameters\": {\n"
"              \"instance_limit_seconds\": 300,\n"
"              \"usage_allocation_seconds\": 220\n"
"          }\n"
"      }'\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    body = {\n"
"        \"name\": \"my-new-instance\",\n"
"        \"target\": \"us-east\",\n"
"        \"resource_plan_id\": \"7f666d17-7893-47d8-bf9d-2b2389fc4dfc\",\n"
"        \"resource_group\": \"<YOUR_RESOURCE_GROUP_ID>\",\n"
"        \"parameters\": {\n"
"            \"instance_limit_seconds\": 300,\n"
"            \"usage_allocation_seconds\": 220,\n"
"        },\n"
"    }\n"
msgstr ""
"    body = {\n"
"        \"name\": \"my-new-instance\",\n"
"        \"target\": \"us-east\",\n"
"        \"resource_plan_id\": \"7f666d17-7893-47d8-bf9d-2b2389fc4dfc\",\n"
"        \"resource_group\": \"<YOUR_RESOURCE_GROUP_ID>\",\n"
"        \"parameters\": {\n"
"            \"instance_limit_seconds\": 300,\n"
"            \"usage_allocation_seconds\": 220,\n"
"        },\n"
"    }\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    resp = requests.post(\n"
"        \"https://resource-controller.cloud.ibm.com/v2/resource_instances\",\n"
"        headers={\n"
"            \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\",\n"
"            \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n"
"        },\n"
"        json=body,\n"
"        timeout=30,\n"
"    )\n"
"    resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"    print(resp.json())\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"    resp = requests.post(\n"
"        \"https://resource-controller.cloud.ibm.com/v2/resource_instances\",\n"
"        headers={\n"
"            \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\",\n"
"            \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n"
"        },\n"
"        json=body,\n"
"        timeout=30,\n"
"    )\n"
"    resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"    print(resp.json())\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"functions-api\" />\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Qiskit Functions access on an instance {#configure-qiskit-functions-access-on-an-instance}"
msgstr "I-configure ang access sa Qiskit Functions sa isang instance {#configure-qiskit-functions-access-on-an-instance}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use these instructions to configure Qiskit Functions access on an existing IBM Quantum Compute Service instance by using the IBM Cloud Resource Controller API.  Follow the instructions in order, as the commands build on each other.  For example, variables such as the token and URL are set in one step and reused in later steps. \n"
msgstr "Gamitin ang mga tagubiling ito para i-configure ang access sa Qiskit Functions sa isang umiiral nang instance ng IBM Quantum Compute Service sa pamamagitan ng paggamit ng IBM Cloud Resource Controller API.  Sundin ang mga tagubilin ayon sa pagkakasunod-sunod, dahil ang mga command ay umaasa sa isa't isa.  Halimbawa, ang mga variable tulad ng token at URL ay itinatakda sa isang hakbang at muling ginagamit sa mga susunod na hakbang. \n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Mga paunang kailangan {#prerequisites}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "An IBM Cloud API key (also called a token).  If necessary, create your API key on the [dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com). \n"
msgstr "Isang IBM Cloud API key (tinatawag ding token).  Kung kinakailangan, lumikha ng iyong API key sa [dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com). \n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The CRN of the instance you want to configure.  The instance's CRN is listed on your [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page.\n"
msgstr "Ang CRN ng instance na gusto mong i-configure.  Ang CRN ng instance ay nakalista sa iyong pahina ng [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Get a bearer token {#step-1-get-a-bearer-token}"
msgstr "Hakbang 1: Kumuha ng bearer token {#step-1-get-a-bearer-token}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exchange your API key for a bearer token. You will pass this token in the authorization header of all resource controller requests. Run the following code to generate a bearer token:\n"
msgstr "Ipagpalit ang iyong API key para sa isang bearer token. Ipapasa mo ang token na ito sa authorization header ng lahat ng resource controller request. Patakbuhin ang sumusunod na code para bumuo ng bearer token:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"curl --request POST \\\n"
"  --url 'https://iam.cloud.ibm.com/identity/token' \\\n"
"  --header 'Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded' \\\n"
"  --data 'apikey=<YOUR_API_KEY>&grant_type=urn%3Aibm%3Aparams%3Aoauth%3Agrant-type%3Aapikey'\n"
"  --silent | jq .\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"import requests\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "api_key = \"<YOUR_API_KEY>\"\n"
msgstr "api_key = \"<YOUR_API_KEY>\"\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"resp = requests.post(\n"
"    \"https://iam.cloud.ibm.com/identity/token\",\n"
"    headers={\"Content-Type\": \"application/x-www-form-urlencoded\"},\n"
"    params={\n"
"        \"apikey\": api_key,\n"
"        \"grant_type\": \"urn:ibm:params:oauth:grant-type:apikey\",\n"
"    },\n"
"    timeout=30,\n"
")\n"
"resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"token = resp.json()[\"access_token\"]\n"
"print(token) \n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"resp = requests.post(\n"
"    \"https://iam.cloud.ibm.com/identity/token\",\n"
"    headers={\"Content-Type\": \"application/x-www-form-urlencoded\"},\n"
"    params={\n"
"        \"apikey\": api_key,\n"
"        \"grant_type\": \"urn:ibm:params:oauth:grant-type:apikey\",\n"
"    },\n"
"    timeout=30,\n"
")\n"
"resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"token = resp.json()[\"access_token\"]\n"
"print(token) \n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The response includes an `access_token` field, which is your bearer token. Copy this value.\n"
msgstr "Kasama sa response ang field na `access_token`, na siyang iyong bearer token. Kopyahin ang halagang ito.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Verify access {#step-2-verify-access}"
msgstr "Hakbang 2: I-verify ang access {#step-2-verify-access}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before making any changes, confirm that your token works and inspect the current instance configuration.\n"
msgstr "Bago gumawa ng anumang pagbabago, kumpirmahin na gumagana ang iyong token at suriin ang kasalukuyang configuration ng instance.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"curl\" label=\"cURL\">\n"
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Important\">\n"
"The CRN must be manually URL-encoded in the path. Replace each `:` with `%3A` and each `/` with `%2F`. For example, `crn:v1:bluemix:...` becomes `crn%3Av1%3Abluemix%3A...`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"curl\" label=\"cURL\">\n"
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Mahalaga\">\n"
"Ang CRN ay dapat na manual na URL-encoded sa path. Palitan ang bawat `:` ng `%3A` at ang bawat `/` ng `%2F`. Halimbawa, ang `crn:v1:bluemix:...` ay nagiging `crn%3Av1%3Abluemix%3A...`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"curl --request GET \\\n"
"  --url 'https://resource-controller.cloud.ibm.com/v2/resource_instances/<YOUR_INSTANCE_CRN_URL_ENCODED>' \\\n"
"  --header 'Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_BEARER_TOKEN>'\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"import urllib.parse\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "crn = \"<YOUR_INSTANCE_CRN>\"\n"
msgstr "crn = \"<YOUR_INSTANCE_CRN>\"\n"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "The CRN will be URL-encoded into the path."
msgstr "Ang CRN ay ise-URL-encode papunta sa path."

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"instance_url = (\n"
"    \"https://resource-controller.cloud.ibm.com/v2/resource_instances/\"\n"
"    + urllib.parse.quote(crn, safe=\"\")\n"
")\n"
"headers = {\"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\", \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"}\n"
msgstr ""
"instance_url = (\n"
"    \"https://resource-controller.cloud.ibm.com/v2/resource_instances/\"\n"
"    + urllib.parse.quote(crn, safe=\"\")\n"
")\n"
"headers = {\"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\", \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"}\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"resp = requests.get(instance_url, headers=headers, timeout=30)\n"
"resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"print(resp.json()[\"extensions\"])\n"
msgstr ""
"resp = requests.get(instance_url, headers=headers, timeout=30)\n"
"resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"print(resp.json()[\"extensions\"])\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A `200 OK` response confirms that your token is valid. The current instance configuration is in the extensions field of the response. Use this instead of parameters, which might be stale.\n"
msgstr "Kinukumpirma ng response na `200 OK` na valid ang iyong token. Ang kasalukuyang configuration ng instance ay nasa field na extensions ng response. Gamitin ito sa halip na parameters, na maaaring luma na.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"step-3\" />\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Look up the account-level functions configuration {#step-3-look-up-the-account-level-functions-configuration}"
msgstr "Hakbang 3: Alamin ang configuration ng functions sa antas ng account {#step-3-look-up-the-account-level-functions-configuration}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "An instance can only be granted access to what the account is entitled to. Before configuring the instance, look up the account's configuration so you know which functions, business models, and permissions are available to grant. This is the source of truth for the values you will send in Step 4.\n"
msgstr "Ang isang instance ay maaari lamang bigyan ng access sa kung ano ang karapat-dapat sa account. Bago i-configure ang instance, alamin ang configuration ng account para malaman mo kung aling mga functions, business models, at permissions ang available na ibigay. Ito ang pinagmumulan ng katotohanan para sa mga halagang ipapadala mo sa Hakbang 4.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Call `GET /accounts/{id}` on the Qiskit Runtime API with your API key. The `{id}` is your account ID without the `a/` prefix.  You can find it from the instance CRN (`crn:v1:bluemix:public:quantum-computing:...:a/<ACCOUNT_ID>:...`).\n"
msgstr "Tawagin ang `GET /accounts/{id}` sa Qiskit Runtime API gamit ang iyong API key. Ang `{id}` ay ang iyong account ID na walang prefix na `a/`.  Makikita mo ito mula sa CRN ng instance (`crn:v1:bluemix:public:quantum-computing:...:a/<ACCOUNT_ID>:...`).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"curl --request GET \\\n"
"  --url 'https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/api/v1/accounts/<ACCOUNT_ID>' \\\n"
"  --header 'Authorization: apikey <YOUR_API_KEY>'\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"account_id = \"<ACCOUNT_ID>\"  # from the CRN: crn:...:a/<ACCOUNT_ID>:...\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"resp = requests.get(\n"
"    f\"https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/api/v1/accounts/{account_id}\",\n"
"    headers={\"Authorization\": f\"apikey {api_key}\"},\n"
"    timeout=30,\n"
")\n"
"resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"for plan in resp.json()[\"plans\"]:\n"
"    print(plan[\"plan_id\"], plan.get(\"functions\"), plan.get(\"custom_functions\"))\n"
msgstr ""
"resp = requests.get(\n"
"    f\"https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/api/v1/accounts/{account_id}\",\n"
"    headers={\"Authorization\": f\"apikey {api_key}\"},\n"
"    timeout=30,\n"
")\n"
"resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"for plan in resp.json()[\"plans\"]:\n"
"    print(plan[\"plan_id\"], plan.get(\"functions\"), plan.get(\"custom_functions\"))\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each plan in the response includes a functions array and, if configured, a `custom_functions` object. These list the exact name, provider, business model, and permissions values you can grant to an instance under that plan.\n"
msgstr "Kasama sa bawat plano sa response ang isang array na functions at, kung na-configure, isang object na `custom_functions`. Nakalista dito ang eksaktong pangalan, provider, business model, at mga halaga ng permissions na maaari mong ibigay sa isang instance sa ilalim ng planong iyon.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"`GET /accounts/{id}` shows what is available to grant at the account level. `GET /functions` (see [Verify the result](#verify-result)) shows what a specific instance has already been granted. Use the **account** endpoint to discover valid values, and the **functions** endpoint to confirm the result.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Configure functions access {#step-4-configure-functions-access}"
msgstr "Hakbang 4: I-configure ang access sa functions {#step-4-configure-functions-access}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Update the instance to grant access to Catalog Functions and Custom Functions.\n"
msgstr "I-update ang instance para bigyan ito ng access sa Catalog Functions at Custom Functions.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Important notes\">\n"
"- The `name`, `provider`, and `business_model` values in functions must exactly match entries configured at the account level (see the [previous step](#step-3)). Permissions must be a non-empty subset of the account's permissions for that function. Similarly, `custom_functions.permissions` must be a non-empty subset of the account's `custom_functions` permissions.\n"
"- Include a timestamp in parameters on every PATCH. The Resource Controller deduplicates PATCH requests by comparing incoming parameters to the last value it stored. If they match, the request is silently dropped with `200 OK` without reaching the service. Include a changing timestamp value to prevent this.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Mahalagang tala\">\n"
"- Ang mga halaga ng `name`, `provider`, at `business_model` sa functions ay dapat eksaktong tumugma sa mga entry na na-configure sa antas ng account (tingnan ang [nakaraang hakbang](#step-3)). Ang permissions ay dapat na isang non-empty subset ng permissions ng account para sa function na iyon. Katulad nito, ang `custom_functions.permissions` ay dapat na isang non-empty subset ng mga permissions ng `custom_functions` ng account.\n"
"- Magsama ng timestamp sa parameters sa bawat PATCH. Dine-deduplicate ng Resource Controller ang mga PATCH request sa pamamagitan ng paghahambing ng papasok na parameters sa huling halagang naimbak nito. Kung magkatugma ang mga ito, tahimik na tinatanggihan ang request na may `200 OK` nang hindi naaabot ang service. Magsama ng nagbabagong halaga ng timestamp para maiwasan ito.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"curl --request PATCH \\\n"
"  --url 'https://resource-controller.cloud.ibm.com/v2/resource_instances/<YOUR_INSTANCE_CRN_URL_ENCODED>' \\\n"
"  --header 'Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_BEARER_TOKEN>' \\\n"
"  --header 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n"
"  --data '{\n"
"    \"parameters\": {\n"
"      \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-30T00:00:00Z\",\n"
"      \"functions\": [\n"
"        {\n"
"          \"name\": \"<FUNCTION_NAME>\",\n"
"          \"provider\": \"<PROVIDER>\",\n"
"          \"business_model\": \"<BUSINESS_MODEL>\",\n"
"          \"permissions\": [\n"
"            \"function.read\",\n"
"            \"function.run\",\n"
"            \"function-files.read\",\n"
"            \"function-files.write\"\n"
"          ]\n"
"        }\n"
"      ],\n"
"      \"custom_functions\": {\n"
"        \"permissions\": [\n"
"          \"function-custom.write\",\n"
"          \"function-custom.run\"\n"
"        ]\n"
"      }\n"
"    }\n"
"  }'\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"from datetime import datetime, timezone\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "A changing timestamp keeps the Resource Controller from de-duplicating the request."
msgstr "Ang isang nagbabagong timestamp ay pumipigil sa Resource Controller mula sa pag-de-duplicate ng request."

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"_now = datetime.now(timezone.utc)\n"
"timestamp = _now.strftime(\"%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S.\") + f\"{_now.microsecond:06d}000Z\"\n"
msgstr ""
"_now = datetime.now(timezone.utc)\n"
"timestamp = _now.strftime(\"%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S.\") + f\"{_now.microsecond:06d}000Z\"\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"body = {\n"
"    \"parameters\": {\n"
"        \"timestamp\": timestamp,\n"
"        \"functions\": [\n"
"            {\n"
"                \"name\": \"<FUNCTION_NAME>\",\n"
"                \"provider\": \"<PROVIDER>\",\n"
"                \"business_model\": \"<BUSINESS_MODEL>\",\n"
"                \"permissions\": [\n"
"                    \"function.read\",\n"
"                    \"function.run\",\n"
"                    \"function-files.read\",\n"
"                    \"function-files.write\",\n"
"                ],\n"
"            }\n"
"        ],\n"
"        \"custom_functions\": {\n"
"            \"permissions\": [\"function-custom.write\", \"function-custom.run\"],\n"
"        },\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"body = {\n"
"    \"parameters\": {\n"
"        \"timestamp\": timestamp,\n"
"        \"functions\": [\n"
"            {\n"
"                \"name\": \"<FUNCTION_NAME>\",\n"
"                \"provider\": \"<PROVIDER>\",\n"
"                \"business_model\": \"<BUSINESS_MODEL>\",\n"
"                \"permissions\": [\n"
"                    \"function.read\",\n"
"                    \"function.run\",\n"
"                    \"function-files.read\",\n"
"                    \"function-files.write\",\n"
"                ],\n"
"            }\n"
"        ],\n"
"        \"custom_functions\": {\n"
"            \"permissions\": [\"function-custom.write\", \"function-custom.run\"],\n"
"        },\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"resp = requests.patch(instance_url, headers=headers, json=body, timeout=30)\n"
"resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"print(resp.json()[\"extensions\"])\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"resp = requests.patch(instance_url, headers=headers, json=body, timeout=30)\n"
"resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"print(resp.json()[\"extensions\"])\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A `200 OK` response indicates success. The updated configuration appears in the extensions field of the response.\n"
msgstr "Ang response na `200 OK` ay nagpapahiwatig ng tagumpay. Ang na-update na configuration ay lilitaw sa field na extensions ng response.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remove functions access {#remove-functions-access}"
msgstr "Alisin ang access sa functions {#remove-functions-access}"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Catalog Functions {#catalog-functions}"
msgstr "Catalog Functions {#catalog-functions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To remove Catalog Functions from an instance, send a PATCH with `\"functions\": null`:\n"
msgstr "Para alisin ang Catalog Functions mula sa isang instance, magpadala ng PATCH na may `\"functions\": null`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"--data '{\n"
"  \"parameters\": {\n"
"    \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-30T00:00:01Z\",\n"
"    \"functions\": null\n"
"  }\n"
"}'\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"body = {\"parameters\": {\"timestamp\": timestamp, \"functions\": None}}\n"
"resp = requests.patch(instance_url, headers=headers, json=body, timeout=30)\n"
"resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setting `\"functions\": []` (an empty array) equivalently clears Catalog Functions. `null` is the canonical form.\n"
msgstr "Ang pagtatakda ng `\"functions\": []` (isang walang laman na array) ay katumbas na nag-a-clear ng Catalog Functions. Ang `null` ang canonical form.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom Functions {#custom-functions}"
msgstr "Custom Functions {#custom-functions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To remove Custom Functions from an instance, send a PATCH with `\"custom_functions\": null`:\n"
msgstr "Para alisin ang Custom Functions mula sa isang instance, magpadala ng PATCH na may `\"custom_functions\": null`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"--data '{\n"
"  \"parameters\": {\n"
"    \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-30T00:00:02Z\",\n"
"    \"custom_functions\": null\n"
"  }\n"
"}'\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"body = {\"parameters\": {\"timestamp\": timestamp, \"custom_functions\": None}}\n"
"resp = requests.patch(instance_url, headers=headers, json=body, timeout=30)\n"
"resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setting `\"custom_functions\": {\"permissions\": []}` equivalently clears custom functions. `null` is the canonical form.\n"
msgstr "Ang pagtatakda ng `\"custom_functions\": {\"permissions\": []}` ay katumbas na nag-a-clear ng custom functions. Ang `null` ang canonical form.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"verify-result\" />\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verify the result {#verify-the-result}"
msgstr "I-verify ang resulta {#verify-the-result}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To confirm that the instance has the correct Qiskit Functions configuration, use `GET /functions` from the Qiskit Runtime API instead of the Resource Controller. The Resource Controller's stored state might be stale if account-level changes updated the instance outside of the Resource Controller.\n"
msgstr "Para kumpirmahin na ang instance ay may tamang configuration ng Qiskit Functions, gamitin ang `GET /functions` mula sa Qiskit Runtime API sa halip na ang Resource Controller. Ang naimbak na estado ng Resource Controller ay maaaring luma na kung ang mga pagbabago sa antas ng account ay nag-update sa instance sa labas ng Resource Controller.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"curl --request GET \\\n"
"  --url 'https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/api/v1/functions' \\\n"
"  --header 'Authorization: apikey <YOUR_API_KEY>' \\\n"
"  --header 'Service-CRN: <YOUR_INSTANCE_CRN>'\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    ```python\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Service-CRN header takes the raw CRN, not the URL-encoded form."
msgstr "Ang header na Service-CRN ay kumukuha ng raw na CRN, hindi ang URL-encoded na form."

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"resp = requests.get(\n"
"    \"https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/api/v1/functions\",\n"
"    headers={\"Authorization\": f\"apikey {api_key}\", \"Service-CRN\": crn},\n"
